# w.lang.en/shards/shape-frames: frames for an arrangement in the shape of something (block 09:50 item F): 8 frames (make or place with the role arrangement: in the shape of, shaped like, X-shaped, in X form), 2 lexicons derived from the outlines of k.layouts.
